      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. I'll write an improved version with better variable names, a descriptive constant for the opaque error message string, and clear comments explaining the test scenario.Now let me compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version extracts the opaque 98-character encoded value into a named constant (`LONG_ENCODED_VALUE`) with an explanatory comment, replaces the deprecated `new Integer(-1)` with `Integer.valueOf(-1)`, renames variables (`encodingMap`, `converter`) for clarity, and adds inline comments explaining why a short decode input triggers the `UnsupportedEncodingException`."
    }
